   "text": {
    "en": "Military Manoeuvres Act\n(CHAPTER 182)\nMilitary Manoeuvres\n(Firing Ground)\nProclamation 2018\nWhereas under section 8 of the Military Manoeuvres Act it is enacted that the Minister for Defence may by proclamation declare an area to be a firing ground:\nNow therefore, the Minister for Defence, in exercise of the powers so conferred, declares that the area specified in the Schedule is a firing ground."
   }
  },
